{"meta":{"id":"tt0904208","type":"series","name":"Californication","description":"Californication es una serie de televisión estadounidense que inició su emisión en 2007 y finalizó el 29 de junio de 2014. Está protagonizada por David Duchovny y Natascha McElhone. La historia sigue al neoyorquino Hank Moody (Duchovny), un problemático novelista que se muda a California y sufre un bloqueo de escritor. Su adicción al alcohol, las drogas y el sexo, complica sus relaciones con su amante Karen (McElhone) y su hija Becca (Madeleine Martin).","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPqOY8cq9KXQN4bD7zJGHCNvcb4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9o9SS26mUY4cp4iSFk7iwBeAQuP.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i2sqr3y49U2fnn9BQ2XHL51cCpX.png","genres":["Comedia","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2007-2014","released":"2007-08-13T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"7.6","runtime":"28 min","trailers":[{"source":"gQ7yaQhXJAI","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["David Duchovny","Natascha McElhone","Evan Handler","Pamela Adlon"],"director":["Tom Kapinos"],"writer":[],"links":[{"name":"David Duchovny","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=David%20Duchovny"},{"name":"Natascha McElhone","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Natascha%20McElhone"},{"name":"Evan Handler","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Evan%20Handler"},{"name":"Pamela Adlon","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Pamela%20Adlon"},{"name":"Tom Kapinos","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Tom%20Kapinos"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"David Duchovny","character":"Hank Moody","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/fD8GuLHOOSSAG98VjwN3NhAmqAJ.jpg","tmdbId":12640},{"name":"Natascha McElhone","character":"Karen van der Beek","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/9pxaoasotR1pdCXYSfN1pkm0geO.jpg","tmdbId":11317},{"name":"Evan Handler","character":"Charlie Runkle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_fac